  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong><u>IEEE Mini Project Symposium 2025 at ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru</u></strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The IEEE Mini Project Symposium 2025 was successfully organized on 25th October 2025 at <strong>ATME College of Engineering</strong>, Mysuru, organized by <strong>IEEE CEDA Bangalore Chapter</strong> in association with <strong>IEEE Bangalore Chapter</strong>, and <strong>IEEE Mysore Subsection</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This symposium provided a vibrant platform for students to showcase their creativity, innovation, and engineering excellence.</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IEEE_Mini_Project_Symposium_2025-report.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
